  "uq_ulama_ilmu_itu_lebih_baik_daripada_harta_ilmu": "Knowledge is better than wealth. Knowledge guards you, while you are the one guarding wealth.",
  "uq_ulama_orang_berilmu_itu_hidup_walau_sudah_wafa": "The learned live on even after death, while the ignorant are dead even while alive.",
  "uq_ulama_jangan_melihat_siapa_yang_berbicara_tapi": "Do not look at who is speaking, but look at what he says.",
  "uq_ulama_nilai_seseorang_diukur_dari_apa_yang_dia": "A person’s worth is measured by what he pursues with sincerity.",
  "uq_ulama_hisablah_dirimu_sendiri_sebelum_kamu_dih": "Hold yourself to account before you are held to account, and weigh your deeds before they are weighed.",
  "uq_ulama_aku_tidak_pernah_menyesal_karena_diam_ta": "I never regretted silence, but I often regretted speaking.",
  "uq_ulama_kehormatanmu_adalah_agamamu_dan_harga_di": "Your honour is your religion, and your dignity is your character.",
  "uq_ulama_waktu_itu_seperti_pedang_kalau_kamu_tida": "Time is like a sword — if you do not cut it, it cuts you.",
  "uq_ulama_ilmu_bukanlah_yang_dihafal_tetapi_ilmu_a": "Knowledge is not what is memorised, but what brings benefit.",
  "uq_ulama_ilmu_itu_cahaya_dan_cahaya_allah_tidak_a": "Knowledge is light, and the light of Allah does not enter the heart of a disobedient person.",
  "uq_ulama_barangsiapa_tidak_tahan_lelahnya_belajar": "Whoever cannot endure the fatigue of learning must endure the pain of ignorance.",
  "uq_ulama_aku_tidak_berhenti_belajar_sejak_aku_men": "I have never stopped learning since I realised how ignorant I still am.",
  "uq_ulama_aku_tidak_memberi_fatwa_sampai_aku_berta": "I do not give a fatwa until I have asked someone more knowledgeable than me.",
  "uq_ulama_manusia_lebih_membutuhkan_ilmu_daripada": "People need knowledge more than they need food and drink.",
  "uq_ulama_aku_tidak_menulis_satu_hadis_pun_melaink": "I did not write down a single hadith without first practising what it says.",
  "uq_ulama_ilmu_tanpa_amal_seperti_pohon_tanpa_buah": "Knowledge without practice is like a tree without fruit.",
  "uq_ulama_anak_adam_hanyalah_kumpulan_hari_hari_se": "The son of Adam is nothing but a bundle of days. Each day that passes takes part of him with it.",
  "uq_ulama_barangsiapa_mengenal_allah_dia_akan_menc": "Whoever knows Allah will love Him; and whoever loves Him will keep busy with Him.",
  "uq_ulama_sesungguhnya_dunia_ini_hanya_sebentar_ja": "This world is only brief, so let us not work for it as though it lasts forever.",
  "uq_ulama_jadikan_dunia_ini_cukup_berada_di_tangan": "Let this world rest in your hand, and never let it enter your heart.",
  "uq_ulama_perbanyaklah_mengingat_mati_karena_itu_m": "Remember death often, for it erases the love of this world.",
  "uq_ulama_aku_tidak_mengobati_sesuatu_yang_lebih_b": "I have never had to remedy anything heavier than my own intention.",
  "uq_ulama_ilmu_itu_untuk_diamalkan_kalau_tidak_dia": "Knowledge is meant to be practised; if it is not, it leaves.",
  "uq_ulama_diam_adalah_hikmah_tapi_sedikit_orang_ya": "Silence is wisdom, but few are willing to practise it.",
  "uq_ulama_sebaik_baik_hati_adalah_yang_dipenuhi_ra": "The best heart is the one filled with fear and hope of Allah.",
  "uq_ulama_tidak_ada_yang_lebih_bermanfaat_bagi_hat": "Nothing benefits the heart more than reading the Quran with reflection.",
  "uq_ulama_hati_bisa_sakit_seperti_badan_sakit_dan": "The heart can fall ill as the body does, and its cure is seeking forgiveness.",
  "uq_ulama_kesabaran_itu_cahaya_dengannya_jalan_yan": "Patience is light — with it a narrow road feels wide.",
  "uq_ulama_ilmu_tanpa_amal_adalah_sia_sia_dan_amal": "Knowledge without practice is wasted, and practice without knowledge is incomplete.",
  "uq_ulama_kebahagiaan_bukan_pada_banyaknya_harta_t": "Happiness is not in having much, but in having a spacious heart.",
  "uq_ulama_siapa_yang_menuntut_ilmu_semata_untuk_me": "Whoever seeks knowledge only to boast, his knowledge will become a case against him.",
  "uq_ulama_jaga_hatimu_karena_allah_melihat_bukan_h": "Guard your heart, for Allah sees not only your deeds but what lies within them.",
